{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786500/extras/3e0ed99cd0aa5c453415133a94275daf.poster.avif?t=1711962689\" width=650 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786500/extras/3e0ed99cd0aa5c453415133a94275daf.webm?t=1711962689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786500/extras/3e0ed99cd0aa5c453415133a94275daf.mp4?t=1711962689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Relationship Anarchy is a top-down 2D procedurally generated mystery game about finding out who is having what kind of a relationship with whom in little towns. <br><br>It also explores connected and diverse relationships in a curious mood as you explore uniquely generated towns, find clues, deduce, infer, and solve the puzzle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786500/extras/eec5586722a2c3ee4d2116e6f5d4be4b.poster.avif?t=1711962689\" width=650 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786500/extras/eec5586722a2c3ee4d2116e6f5d4be4b.webm?t=1711962689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786500/extras/eec5586722a2c3ee4d2116e6f5d4be4b.mp4?t=1711962689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Every town, house, relationship, character and clue is procedurally generated to guarantee a unique gameplay.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786500/extras/f993ebe715991e1be0b8918b28c17038.poster.avif?t=1711962689\" width=650 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786500/extras/f993ebe715991e1be0b8918b28c17038.webm?t=1711962689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786500/extras/f993ebe715991e1be0b8918b28c17038.mp4?t=1711962689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Do you like to explore the scene, find clues, deduce, infer, and solve the puzzle?<br>With procedural generation at it's core, the game features unique mystery puzzles, that no one has solved before. It's a classic investigation game, where you have to find the right clues to make your deductions, and then solve the case.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786500/extras/2c3e008f89820f26a1543d11dd12646a.avif?t=1711962689\" width=668 height=210 /></span><br>As well as a progressive adventure mode, Relationship Anarchy also features a generator where the player can generate their own towns.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786500/extras/bc07f10cd8300f424a0f4cc806cccd9c.poster.avif?t=1711962689\" width=650 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786500/extras/bc07f10cd8300f424a0f4cc806cccd9c.webm?t=1711962689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786500/extras/bc07f10cd8300f424a0f4cc806cccd9c.mp4?t=1711962689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>I want you to be happy with your purchase. Below is a small guide to help make your decision.<br><br>How many of the following 4 points do you agree with?<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> I love games heavy on procedural generation<br></li><li> I love mystery games where I need to figure out the clues, and solve the puzzle<br></li><li> I love experimental small indie games that are not mainstream<br></li><li> I love to support developers that focus on LGBTQIA+ diversity in their games</li></ul><br><strong>3-4 points:</strong><br>You will love this game. A no-brainer.<br><br><strong>2-3 points:</strong><br>I'm confidently recommending this game to you. You'll have a good time.<br><br><strong>1-2 points:</strong><br>Hmmm. Not entirely sure you'll like this game. Maybe wait for a good discount?<br><br><strong>0 points:</strong><br>This game is just not for you.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"All the names","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2786500/9fd0ba2c836d5e6e3a11e10c47bc64ac8e340876.jpg"},{"name":"All the relationships","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2786500/9e6aebb0c5dbea12a8c5e18fec04663ac19dedb3.jpg"},{"name":"Generator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2786500/774590397ec35d084dc4b0063fc3b36bc5f41ee2.jpg"},{"name":"Find a game controller","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2786500/8fbba38469af2709461712b311954273b44e4416.jpg"},{"name":"Retrieve something","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2786500/1de5e7dfe29bffae58617355b9a2a2945185e304.jpg"},{"name":"Waffle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2786500/797cb4e4e7b7fcdfc4e3f691f01e89f5a4797be6.jpg"},{"name":"Adventure Challenge!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2786500/b5a0c9296a4fdf6ca77fb5f57e6638da5ef12c00.jpg"},{"name":"Sarcasm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2786500/839f4ceb873a3ecafa57fa2c36ecdea040047afc.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2786500?t=1711962689","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it